From 2e6f62806d4a9c34a49962ba1d1f0bca357ff646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ammar <surfmemo58@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 01:43:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Legion Game Zone support (LenovoLegionToolkit-derived) +
 CLT-only build

Kext (IdeaWMIGameZone / IdeaSMC / IdeaVPC):
- Power mode (Fn+Q smart fan mode) get/set via LENOVO_GAMEZONE_DATA 44/45,
  SMART_FAN_MODE / THERMAL / KEYLOCK / CHARGE / LIGHT events, WExx enabled
- Touchpad lock, Win key lock, display overdrive toggles, IGPU mode (read only)
- Sensors from LENOVO_OTHER_METHOD GetFeatureValue (LLT CapabilityID) with
  Game Zone fallback; IdeaSMC publishes F0Ac/F1Ac/FNum/F0Mx, TCXC, TG0P/TG0D, TPCD
- Read-only debug interface: WMIQuery, WMIBlock, ProbeAll, DumpACPI
- Fixed Game Zone method ids 0x2E-0x30 to match the BMOF
- Events forwarded to YogaSMCNC as 0x20-0x25 (kSMC_LegionEvent)

YogaSMCNC: Legion menu section (power mode, temps/fans, battery/keyboard toggles)

Tools: build-kext.sh / build-app.sh (no Xcode), yogactl, smckeys

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
